WEBVTT

00:30:58.542 --> 00:31:00.393
And I don't like it in part because --

00:31:00.417 --> 00:31:03.018
EP: I think it's beautiful.
AG: I think it's sickening.

00:31:03.042 --> 00:31:04.059
(Laughter)

00:31:04.083 --> 00:31:06.018
I like to avoid it as much as possible,

00:31:06.042 --> 00:31:10.476
but I say that because I think
most of us have a dominant trait,

00:31:10.500 --> 00:31:13.476
which is the trait where
we're either the most extreme

00:31:13.500 --> 00:31:16.309
or the trait that's most
central to defining us.

00:31:16.333 --> 00:31:18.268
And I've noticed over the last few years

00:31:18.292 --> 00:31:22.018
when both kind of, I guess, reflecting
and reading personality research

00:31:22.042 --> 00:31:24.768
that my dominant trait
is conscientiousness.

00:31:24.792 --> 00:31:26.351
I am a goal-oriented person

00:31:26.375 --> 00:31:29.726
and that means I will bend and stretch
all my other traits

00:31:29.750 --> 00:31:31.476
in service of achieving my goals.